WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.671
ORDER BY inside OVER is part of the analytical
definition For

00:00:05.698 --> 00:00:11.338
ranking it defines higher and lower positions For
LAG and LEAD

00:00:11.575 --> 00:00:17.547
it defines previous and next For running totals it
defines the sequence

00:00:17.574 --> 00:00:23.584
of accumulation When ordering values can tie add a
stable tie-breaker

00:00:23.611 --> 00:00:25.821
when deterministic row sequence matters
